    values:originalText "Add:  Amendment of the Australian Human Rights Commission Act 1986  Schedule 2  Human Rights Legislation Amendment Act 2017 Compilation date: 01/09/2021 Registered: 03/11/2021  (5) The President has power to do all things necessary or convenient to be done for or in connection with the performance of his or her functions." ;
