doc:sch-2-sec-36-ss-8 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "36(8) At the end of section 46PF" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(8) For the purposes of paragraphs (7)(a), (b) and (c), the President must notify the respondent or the other person, as the case may be:  Schedule 2  Amendment of the Australian Human Rights Commission Act 1986  Human Rights Legislation Amendment Act 2017  Compilation date: 01/09/2021 Registered: 03/11/2021  (a) under paragraph (7)(a)—as soon as the President has decided to inquire into the complaint; or  (b) under paragraph (7)(b)—as soon as the complaint has been amended; or  (c) under paragraph (7)(c)—as soon as the President forms the opinion that the person is the subject of an adverse allegation arising from the complaint." ;
    cof:pageNumber "13"^^xsd:integer .

concept:human-rights-legislation-amendment-act-2017-sch-2-sec-36-ss-9 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "36(9) At the end of section 46PF"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-36-ss-9 ;
    values:originalText "(9) For the purposes of subsections (7) and (8), adverse allegation means an allegation:  (a) that:  (i) one or more acts have been done; or  (ii) one or more omissions or practices have occurred; and  (b) that those acts, omissions or practices are unlawful discrimination. Note: Unlawful discrimination is defined in subsection 3(1)." ;
    skos:definition "(9) For the purposes of subsections (7) and (8), adverse allegation means an allegation:  (a) that:  (i) one or more acts have been done; or  (ii) one or more omissions or practices have occurred; and  (b) that those acts, omissions or practices are unlawful discrimination. Note: Unlawful discrimination is defined in subsection 3(1)."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "553173aa65ff5925d51aa48a375010b963c52d0969e537a5332fd6f63b3a597b" ;
    values:partOf concept:human-rights-legislation-amendment-act-2017-sch-2-sec-36 ;
    cof:pageNumber "13"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Definition of adverse allegation for purposes of subsections (7) and (8)" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
