concept:human-rights-legislation-amendment-act-2017-sch-2-sec-42 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "42 At the end of subsection 46PH(1)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-42 ;
    values:originalText "Add: Note: An act, omission or practice may not be unlawful discrimination because an exemption applies (for example, section 18D of the Racial Discrimination Act 1975). Accordingly, consideration by the President of the question of whether an act, omission or practice is not unlawful discrimination will involve consideration of whether an exemption applies." ;
    skos:definition "Add: Note: An act, omission or practice may not be unlawful discrimination because an exemption applies (for example, section 18D of the Racial Discrimination Act 1975). Accordingly, consideration by the President of the question of whether an act, omission or practice is not unlawful discrimination will involve consideration of whether an exemption applies."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "75c6cd73c65b9d72e3f00ae17512ed7719eec1e323fffbb7cd7f028d30cbddda" ;
    cof:pageNumber "15"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Consideration of exemption applies to determination of non-unlawful discrimination" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <human-rights-legislation-amendment-act-2017.pdf> ;
    dc:source "human-rights-legislation-amendment-act-2017.pdf, p.15" ;
