    values:originalText "Insert:  (3A) The application must not be made unless:  (a) the court concerned grants leave to make the application; or  (b) the complaint was terminated under paragraph 46PH(1)(h); or  (c) the complaint was terminated under paragraph 46PH(1B)(b).  Schedule 2  Amendment of the Australian Human Rights Commission Act 1986  Human Rights Legislation Amendment Act 2017  Compilation date: 01/09/2021 Registered: 03/11/2021" ;
