    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-54 ;
    values:originalText "Add: Note 1: The Federal Court, or a judge of that court, may award costs in proceedings under this section—see section 43 of the Federal Court of Australia Act 1976. Note 2: The Federal Circuit Court, or a judge of that court, may award costs in proceedings under this section—see section 79 of the Federal Circuit Court of Australia Act 1999." ;
